│ placeholder in something-to-include.rst, but the change isn’t      │
│ propagating to the generated HTML output. This likely stems from   │
│ how Sphinx handles the inclusion process and potentially how the   │
│ extension interacts with the generated HTML.  Given the limited    │
│ context and my inability to reliably use the API calls, the most   │
│ reasonable approach is to make a targeted change that addresses    │
